a clean step fits a monotone capacity between the last cached and first spilled working set: true
a launch-bound point below the fastest one does not break the fit: true
the recorded tuf sweep fits a monotone capacity between 1.08 GB and 2.16 GB: true
a sweep that never crosses fits no capacity: true
rates that do not split by working set fit a capacity flagged non-monotone: true
one timed point fits nothing: true
every swept extent is timed and requests at least its operands' distinct bytes: true
